# Direct dependencies only. Edit this file, never requirements.txt.
#
# Regenerate the pinned lockfile after any change here:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt --python-version 3.9
#
# Render installs requirements.txt, which pins the whole tree so that two
# deploys a month apart install identical bytes. The build cache is off, so
# every deploy re-resolves from PyPI -- without pins, that means every deploy
# is a fresh roll of the dice on upstream releases.
Flask
Flask-SQLAlchemy
Flask-JWT-Extended
Flask-Cors
gunicorn
psycopg2-binary
stripe
boto3
